{"name":"Inside","hex":"#221122","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"inside","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The interior or inner part.","The left-hand side of a road if one drives on the left, or right-hand side if one drives on the right."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to the inner surface, limit or boundary.","Nearer to the interior or centre of something."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/inside"}],"entries":[{"title":"Inside (1996 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Inside is a 1996 cable television film directed by Arthur Penn based on a script by Bima Stagg. It was the Penn's final film before dying in 2010. The film was shot in Johannesburg, South Africa and premiered in the United States on Showtime on 25 August 1996. The film was then released theatrically in several markets and played at several film festivals around the world including Cannes, Toronto, San Francisco and Munich. The film was nominated for an Emmy, and a Cable Ace Award."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/ff/Inside_%281996_film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inside_(1996_film)","wikidata":"Q6037477"},{"title":"Inside (2002 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Inside is a Québécois film directed by Michel Jetté and released in 2002, about a young man's time in a penitentiary. It is based on Léo Lévesque's collection of prison stories Contes en coup de poing. The film was classified 13+ in Québec and 18+ in the United Kingdom, and features Emmanuel Auger, Karyne Lemieux and David Boutin."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/00/Histoire_de_Pen_FilmPoster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inside_(2002_film)","wikidata":"Q3136785"},{"title":"Inside (web series)","blocks":[{"text":"Inside is a reality competition web series created and hosted by British YouTube group the Sidemen, first premiered on 2 June 2024 on the Sidemen YouTube channel. The series features celebrity and internet personality contestants who compete in challenges to secure a prize fund totalled at £1 million, with everything they buy or do costing money from the prize fund."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inside_(web_series)","wikidata":"Q126721305"},{"title":"Inside (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Inside is a 2016 puzzle-platform horror game developed and published by Playdead. The game was released for the Xbox One in June 2016, Windows in July, and PlayStation 4 in August, followed by releases for iOS in December 2017, Nintendo Switch in June 2018, and macOS in June 2020. The player controls a boy in a dystopian world, solving environmental puzzles and avoiding death. It is Playdead's second game following Limbo (2010), sharing similar 2.5D gameplay."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/50/INSIDE_Xbox_One_cover_art.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inside_(video_game)","wikidata":"Q22019785"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/23/Inside_huddle_concept_art.png/250px-Inside_huddle_concept_art.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/23/Inside_huddle_concept_art.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/23/Inside_huddle_concept_art.png/250px-Inside_huddle_concept_art.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"2010 concept art of the Huddle by Morten Bramsen. The art helped animate the Huddle and drive Inside's art direction.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AInside_huddle_concept_art.png"}],"sounds":{"inside":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/En-us-inside.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/En-us-inside.ogg/En-us-inside.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Black by Stuart Mentiply","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/Black_by_Stuart_Mentiply.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","ratio":0.7220216606498195,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Black_by_Stuart_Mentiply.jpg","share":0.275625},{"title":"Black Hole Outflows From Centaurus A","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Black_Hole_Outflows_From_Centaurus_A.jpg/500px-Black_Hole_Outflows_From_Centaurus_A.jpg","ratio":0.9877868245743894,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Black_Hole_Outflows_From_Centaurus_A.jpg","share":0.243125},{"title":"Khairdeen urf Pritam, Black and White","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Khairdeen_urf_Pritam%2C_Black_and_White.jpg/500px-Khairdeen_urf_Pritam%2C_Black_and_White.jpg","ratio":1.4992458521870287,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Khairdeen_urf_Pritam,_Black_and_White.jpg","share":0.220625},{"title":"Inside Balconies Cave at Pinnacles National Monument 1","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Inside_Balconies_Cave_at_Pinnacles_National_Monument_1.jpg/500px-Inside_Balconies_Cave_at_Pinnacles_National_Monument_1.jpg","ratio":0.6707577374599787,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Inside_Balconies_Cave_at_Pinnacles_National_Monument_1.jpg","share":0.1875},{"title":"Sighisoara - covered staircase - inside view","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Sighisoara_-_covered_staircase_-_inside_view.jpg/500px-Sighisoara_-_covered_staircase_-_inside_view.jpg","ratio":1.4938271604938271,"link":"https://commons.wikime